     "titulo": "Ordering activities",
     "texto": [
      "**Πρώτα**, **μετά**, **ύστερα** and **τέλος** mean first, then, later and finally.",
      "To talk about a routine, the present can go with frequency expressions: **κάθε μέρα** (every day), **συνήθως** (usually) and **σπάνια** (rarely). **Ξυπνάω** means «to wake up» and **κοιμάμαι** means «to sleep»."
     ],
